// hola: a greeting, from the command line and from a web page. The example the
// viewer is tried on (ds render examples/hola): two external interfaces, three
// modules, a taxonomy inside a module (Formal and Casual realise the interface
// Style), one across modules (Console and Response inherit the abstract Channel),
// and every kind of ownership (Greeter owns, refers to and shares).
//
// The high level design: the boxes of the system and what each one is for.
//
//   core    the logic, with no idea what runs it
//   app     the command line process: a command line into a call and an exit code
//   server  the web process: a request into a call and a response

package hola {
  module core { }
  module app { }
  module server { }
}
